<title>UK: European vacuum gas oil unchanged and slow.</title>
<headline>European vacuum gas oil unchanged and slow.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>bid/ask	prev bid/ask</p>
<p> Low sulphur cargoes fob NWE	  163/165	  163/165</p>
<p> High sulphur cargoes fob NWE	 149/151	  149/151</p>
<p> High sulphur barges fob ARA	  156/157	  156/157</p>
<p> Formula quotation fob Med	     08/12	    08/12</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The European vacuum gas oil market remained very quiet on Friday caught between the mid-week Christmas holiday and next week's New Year holiday.</p>
<p>&quot;I'm not doing anything and I can't see any one else getting very bothered today,&quot; said one trader at a major.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8980</p>
